WEBVTT

00:05:25.484 --> 00:05:30.231
to eat lousy food in a noisy mess hall.

00:05:30.231 --> 00:05:32.436
It became normal for me to go with my father

00:05:32.436 --> 00:05:35.384
to bathe in a mass shower.

00:05:35.384 --> 00:05:39.645
Being in a prison, a barbed-wire prison camp,

00:05:39.645 --> 00:05:43.269
became my normality.

00:05:43.269 --> 00:05:44.910
When the war ended,

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:46.962
we were released,

00:05:46.962 --> 00:05:48.968
and given a one-way ticket

00:05:48.968 --> 00:05:52.534
to anywhere in the United States.

00:05:52.534 --> 00:05:54.435
My parents decided to go back home

00:05:54.435 --> 00:05:57.003
to Los Angeles,

00:05:57.003 --> 00:06:01.384
but Los Angeles was not a welcoming place.